rs, Nightlife, Pubs","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","review_id":"WEkAR2gmV62mViOJE5fRLg","date":"2014-12-30T05:27:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9496939182281494,"text_excerpt":"Last Sunday, we were walking around trying to find a place to have a good, casual time, and we came across the District. This bar has a very neighborhood feel to it, and it seems as if most people that were there live close to the bar. The bar was obviously not the most beautiful place I've ever seen, but they had some pretty large TVs which are great for watching whatever big game is on. The bartenders were really welcoming and friendly. I think the chef must have been bored with the lack of orders on a Sunday, because randomly, the bartender brings us fries and a quesadilla that we never ordered! It was awesome! The fries come with some queso-y gravy sauce which is really awesome. We or..."},{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","review_id":"-NV9YHFGLQ9CcaxbWiIyfg","date":"2011-06-14T15:31:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9297247529029846,"text_excerpt":"I want to say that this place is new, although it has been here since last October....but it feels new to me. Maybe that's because I just found it LOL Pretty sad when you consider that I live literally two blocks away. Quite sad, indeed! In any case, on with the review! A co-worker introduced me to this place a couple months back and I find myself in here almost every weekend. This is a nice place to hang out BEFORE A) either heading back home or B) heading on to another, more lively environment. This is just a great place to chill, meet people, watch the game and relax after a long day of work. This is NOT the type of place that you spend all of your time nor should it be the last stop o..."},{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","review_id":"WRokW-Y7Cxidpmdy_SKy7g","date":"2015-12-29T19:53:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9186388254165649,"text_excerpt":"Great place for a drink and to catch a game. I live in the area and frequent it. The crowds are manageable and prices are reasonable. The bar food offerings are good as well. The wait staff is friendly and ownership cares about the quality of service. Definitely recommended!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","photo_id":"Yd7tmnHP3VTKZamllK-UGQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Yd7tmnHP3VTKZamllK-UGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9342007637023926},{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","photo_id":"Ta5_-xAVvtTtcS7Y-NrIVg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ta5_-xAVvtTtcS7Y-NrIVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8947968482971191},{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","photo_id":"urfi-DLe8UhY6nHOI9YSYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/urfi-DLe8UhY6nHOI9YSYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901153802871704},{"business_id":"nBDWXS5Kqf5VNxh8lZpb2A","photo_id":"ZvdScjGQMrA1HeVr5pDavA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZvdScjGQMrA1HeVr5pDavA.jpg","visual_representativeness